          {
            "kind": "text",
            "id": "summary",
            "text": "Seeded, splittable random streams that give the same numbers on every platform and Python version."
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "id": "meta",
            "text": "License: MIT · Author: Northstar · Requires: Python >=3.9 · Latest release: 2.0.0 (2026)"
          },
          {
            "kind": "heading",
            "id": "desc-h",
            "text": "Project description",
            "level": 2
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "id": "desc",
            "text": "seedrng implements a PCG generator with a fixed algorithm, so a seed produces the same stream on every platform and every Python version, which random.Random does not promise across releases. Streams can be split by name so that two components each get an independent, reproducible stream from one root seed."
          },
